※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4553

※ A name is brought in once, by value or by reference.  Twice would be two
※ ways of reaching one variable inside one body, and which of them a mention
※ meant would not be decidable.

@[startup, impure]
fn main() → u6:
    let n: u8 = 1u8
    let f: fn(u8) → u8 = λ a: u8 [n, n] → u8 { a + n }
    0u6
